  "job_B15.3.60_20260920_210319": {
    "text": "\u00d0is syn \u00fea gerihto and \u00fea laga, thet archebiscop ah ofer eal Euerwic bynan burh an butan.\n\u00de\u00e6t is, aerest Legera\u00feorp and on nordhealf Munecagate & fra \u00deurbrandes hus eal up on Walbegate and\nMid sace & mid socne, mid tolle & mid teme, and alcne \u00feridde penig, \u00fee cumde up on Walbegate and\nAnd \u00feridde penig of \u00feone fiscoup scrasudwrasas ford yb dic and \u00feonne \u00feridde, \u00fee up cum\u00f0 of les\nAnd alc man, \u00fee mid coupfare cume to Euerwyc, eastan odde nordan, sudan odde westan, mid horsum\nAnd fare alc man \u00fee come wille he to kynges scire, wille he to biscopes, be Godes leoue and \u00fees kynges.\nAnd swa hwilc coupman so cumth into biscopes scire and coupad in kinges scire, gyfe \u00fean kinge \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd gif ani man formaele hine sylfne of biscopes scire innan kynges scire, habbe se king.\nAnd ealle \u00fea unriht \u00f0e man wirced, gehaded man odde lawede, hoc est se l\u00e6reda misbeode freolses daes\n\u00dee man wirces binnan burh & butan, ne \u00f0eo kinges greua ne eorles to \u00feissum giltum, buton biscop and\nAnd twa minetras hafy se biscop in Euerwic.\n\u00d0is is to gewitnesse Arngrim Monachus & Oudergrim & Clibern & Wlfstan & Ouldalf & Ulfkil &\nAnd se ercebiscopes hirde & Huga sciregreuan and Willem of Snotingham and Beringar \u00feaes kynges\nAnd habbe he Godes grame \u00fee \u00feis undo; Amen.",
